00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, yeah,
we want to set a cushion.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, but, I mean,
fortunately,

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.280 line:92%
I still enjoy doing the show

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.715 line:92%
The fans still love the show

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:58.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm loving working wit
Mariska every day

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
