and everybody.

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.021 line:92%
And we've got a new girl, Jamie.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're having a really good tim
over there.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.925
So people always say, "Ice, ho
could you do the show so long?

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.528
