it's an interesting job.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:16.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not boring at all.
-That's fantastic.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:17.570 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I bet, by the way,

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
