00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:26.312
So I would just keep an ey
on those "Chicago" shows,

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I know
they're getting up there.

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's the guy
you got to keep an eye on.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:33.253 size:81% position:41%
-The trick is you stay
in the Wolf universe.

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.954 size:78% position:39%
Like when people say,
