if he likes you.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:50.803 size:75% position:38% line:92%
He seems to like me.

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:54.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is my fifth show I've don
with Dick Wolf, fifth show

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:59.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
I started on "New York
Undercover" as a guest star,

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:01.881 size:78% position:39%
