"Law &amp; Order: SVU."

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I've been working with
Dick Wolf for over 25 years.

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:18.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm probably
one of his longest --

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:24.604
I probably am his longest
continuous running actor

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.272 size:88% position:44% line:92%
outside of maybe Epatha.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.208 line:92%
-I think this is important als

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:31.377
that he is teaching people tha
a life of crime doesn't pay,

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:34.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
because when you're a criminal
