00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you figured out
if you're a cop,

00:03:37.517 --> 00:03:39.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're just in it
for the long haul.

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:40.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I learned that.
I played enough bad guys,

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:45.091
I played enough criminals,
so I know you get one shot

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.059 line:92%
You get to play the bad guy --

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:47.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
