00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:52.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know,
it's fun, it's acting.

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:56.236
People know Ice-T is about a
far as you can get from a cop.

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:59.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we call that in the busines
"a stretch."

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:01.608 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.608 --> 00:04:04.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How -- A lot of people have
been stretching

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:05.845 size:84% position:42% line:92%
