00:04:11.618 --> 00:04:12.385 size:88% position:44% line:92%
How has that been going?

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.454 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, not technically
homeschooling her.

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:19.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chanel just turned 5, so she'l
start school in September.

00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:22.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
-And we didn't really decide t

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:23.096 size:81% position:41% line:92%
take her to preschool.

00:04:23.096 --> 00:04:24.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
I told her, I don't think
