00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.944
These five years, she'll learn
more just being with you all day

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:41.080
than she probably will getting
shipped out to a preschool."

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot of kids go to preschoo
because their parents

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:47.186
have to work and it's kind o
like preschool/babysitter.

00:04:47.186 --> 00:04:48.154 size:78% position:39% line:92%
So Chanel is with us.

00:04:48.154 --> 00:04:51.424
I think the hardest thing is
when she starts school is Coco

00:04:51.424 --> 00:04:53.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
Coco's going to lose
her best friend

00:04:53.893 --> 00:04:55.595 line:92%
