00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:57.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
So Chanel will be like,
"Bye, Mommy."

00:04:57.897 --> 00:04:59.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Chanel will be the one
crying --

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean Coco will be the on
crying in the car.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:04.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You did add
some more family members.

00:05:04.203 --> 00:05:06.339 align:start size:94% position:6%
We've talked
