00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:09.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have two English bulldogs,
Maximus and Alexis.

00:05:09.742 --> 00:05:10.943 size:78% position:39% line:92%
They had five babies.

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:14.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
We actually have a picture her
of the bulldog puppies.

00:05:14.614 --> 00:05:17.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And you kept two, correct

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:21.387
-Yeah, what happened was our
first bulldog was Spartacus,

00:05:21.387 --> 00:05:26.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
and what happened was
Spartacus passed away early,

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:29.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
