to keep the bloodline.

00:05:31.264 --> 00:05:32.932 line:92%
We were like, "You know what?"

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:36.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
We work with
Long Island Bulldog Rescue

00:05:36.069 --> 00:05:39.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
We know about rescuing dog
and all of that kind of thing,

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:42.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
but with bulldogs, it's like
before you even get ready

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
to breed them,
somebody wants them.

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:45.611 size:84% position:42%
You know, so it's not
like they're gonna ever

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:46.946 size:78% position:39% line:92%
be in that situation.

00:05:46.946 --> 00:05:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
So Coco was like,
"I want to breed Max.

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:53.619 size:84% position:42%
I want to keep Max."
Max is now 9, the baby.

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:55.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So we got Alexis,

00:05:55.388 --> 00:05:57.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
